<title>USA: Helmerich to sell unit to Occidental.</title>
<headline>Helmerich to sell unit to Occidental.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helmerich &amp; Payne Inc said Tuesday it entered into a definitive agreement under which Occidental Petroleum Corp will acquire its Baytown, Texas-based Natural Gas Odorizing Inc subsidiary.</p>
<p>The total acquisition value will be about $48 million, payable in Occidental common stock.</p>
<p>Closing is expected on August 30.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
